[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_TRUTH_TALISMAN_OF_TONATIUH]
Truth Talisman of Tonatiuh

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_TRUTH_TALISMAN_OF_TONATIUH_DESC]
When wearing the Truth Talisman of Tonatiuh, the wearer will be forced to tell the truth, otherwise they will be unable to speak. This artifact can significantly improve our ability to discover enemy spies, but our scientists have come up with more interesting ideas...
“Excuse me, how to make a time machine? How to make a magic perpetual motion machine? How to build a thousand storm airships at the lowest cost?” The scientist looked at the wearer with great expectations.
“...”
“...”
“I don’t know. I don’t know. I don’t know.”

